'''Arrogance of the Vaal''' is a [[divination card]]. A set of eight can be exchanged for a random [[corrupted]] [[unique item]] with two [[corruption implicit modifier]]s.

==Rewards==
'''Arrogance of the Vaal''' will reward an item with item level corresponding to the redeeming character's [[character level]], up to a maximum of ilvl 80. [[Drop level]] restrictions are ignored when choosing which [[unique item]] will be rewarded, however the generated corrupted implicits will respect their item level restrictions, thus redeeming these cards using a low level character can influence the set of possible implicits.

